      getPublisher, resolveContributors, resolvePublishers,
      searchContributors, searchPublishers and listEditionsByContributor.
    - Answer malformed entity URIs and unknown identifiers with the
      documented 400/404 envelope, and share the catalog error mapping with
      the existing edition methods.
